    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin hides WooCommerce products either by category or individually. You can:<br />\n* Check categories to hide all products in them.<br />\n* Use a live search field to hide specific products.<br />\n* Optionally mark products as hidden in the product edit screen.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder <code>hide-products-for-woocommerce</code> to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from your WordPress admin.</li>\n<li>Go to &#8220;Visibility Control&#8221; under WooCommerce to manage hidden categories/products.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20this%20plugin%20require%20woocommerce%3F'>\nDoes this plugin require WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, WooCommerce must be active.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial version with category hiding, product hiding, and live search.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Hide product categories or individual products from your WooCommerce store. Also includes a live search for selecting hidden products.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin hides WooCommerce products either by category or individually. You can:<br />\n* Check categories to hide all products in them.<br />\n* Use a live search field to hide specific products.<br />\n* Optionally mark products as hidden in the product edit screen.</p>\n",
